        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aurelia Plath, Otto Plath, Sylvia Plath, Warren Plath, Nicholas Farrar Hughes, Frieda Rebecca Hughes\n- Roles: wife, husband, mother, father, grandmother, fisheries biologist\n\nFacts:\n- Aurelia Frances Plath, née Schober, was born on April 26, 1906, and died on March 11, 1994.\n- Aurelia Plath was the wife of Otto Emil Plath.\n- Otto Plath was the father of Sylvia Plath and Warren Plath.\n- Aurelia Plath was the mother of Sylvia Plath and Warren Plath.\n- Aurelia Plath was the grandmother of Frieda Rebecca Hughes and Nicholas Farrar Hughes.\n- Nicholas Farrar Hughes was born on January 17, 1962, and died on March 16, 2009.\n- Nicholas Farrar Hughes was a fisheries biologist known as an expert in stream salmonid ecology.",
